473
00:42:12,697 --> 00:42:13,782
Aku rindu dia.

474
00:42:25,252 --> 00:42:27,212
Halo, apa kau Nelly?

475
00:42:27,796 --> 00:42:29,589
Terima kasih sudah menjemputku.

476
00:42:29,673 --> 00:42:32,425
Aku sudah berputar-putar di sini dua kali.

477
00:42:33,426 --> 00:42:36,388
Tak apa. Aku berputar tiga kali
saat baru pertama sampai.

478
00:42:36,471 --> 00:42:37,889
Biar kubawakan tasmu.

479
00:42:37,973 --> 00:42:39,057
Tak perlu.

480
00:42:40,267 --> 00:42:43,144
Cuma melewati tangga ini, agak tinggi.

481
00:42:43,645 --> 00:42:44,938
Terima kasih.

482
00:42:47,232 --> 00:42:48,900
Baiklah, ayo.

483
00:42:50,068 --> 00:42:53,321
Ini pertama kali aku di Málaga.
Aku menantikannya.

484
00:42:53,405 --> 00:42:55,615
-Benarkah?
-Ya.

485
00:42:59,119 --> 00:43:00,120
