Tempat ini…

548
00:53:46,349 --> 00:53:47,350
Halo.

549
00:53:47,433 --> 00:53:48,434
Halo.

550
00:54:13,000 --> 00:54:14,210
Nikmati harimu.

551
00:55:01,090 --> 00:55:02,133
Itu cocok untukmu.

552
00:55:04,468 --> 00:55:05,886
Kenapa kau sendirian?

553
00:55:06,804 --> 00:55:08,431
Kalian harusnya bersama.

554
00:55:09,098 --> 00:55:10,766
Kau ingat?

555
00:55:11,517 --> 00:55:13,060
Belum berubah sama sekali.

556
00:55:18,357 --> 00:55:21,444
Benar. Belum berubah sama sekali.

557
00:55:37,585 --> 00:55:39,587
BANDARA MÁLAGA-COSTA DEL SOL

558
00:56:16,499 --> 00:56:18,918
PANGGILAN MASUK
KAK JEONG-MIN

559
00:56:21,420 --> 00:56:22,421
Hai, Kak Jeong-min.

560
00:56:26,258 --> 00:56:28,511
Kak Jeong-min, kenapa?

561
00:56:35,518 --> 00:56:36,936
PANGGILAN MASUK
KAK JEONG-MIN

562
00:56:37,728 --> 00:56:38,729
Hai, Kak Jeong-min.

563
00:57:01,752 --> 00:57:03,003
Kyeong-do,

564
